{"id":"452997","name":"花旗参三鲜汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/452997/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花旗参","amount":"50g"},{"name":"急冻鲍鱼","amount":"4个"},{"name":"海参","amount":"2条"},{"name":"花胶","amount":"90g"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"花旗参洗净，用热水泡软。(泡的水留用)","img":"images/452997/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"瘦肉飞水，洗净浮沫。","img":"images/452997/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鲍鱼解冻，刷干净周边的黑膜。","img":"images/452997/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"花胶飞水。","img":"images/452997/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切小块。","img":"images/452997/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"泡发好的海参飞水。","img":"images/452997/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"切小块。","img":"images/452997/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"花旗参剁碎，使其容易出味。","img":"images/452997/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把材料放入电压力锅，按煲汤键开煮。","img":"images/452997/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"清热滋补养颜。","img":"images/452997/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煲好放盐调味即可。","img":"images/452997/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"清补养颜。","img":"images/452997/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}